msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Is there anything fancier you can sell?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Let's discuss prototypes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I have found more of those golden robots, can you make anything of them yet?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"I need some gear to outfit my crew, I think five sets of police riot armor "
"would do the trick."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "I'm here and I've got the goods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Cost of the armor plus everything left in the tower."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"&The intercom crackles with static as it turns on.  The LED next to the "
"button lights up a bright red, and the camera lens whirs as it focuses on "
"you.  There is no immediate response."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid "Well truth be told, this encounter ain't quite so random."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"We are listening…\n"
"\n"
"You detect a slight elevation in their voice, with a start you realize they are nervous."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Actually I was just joking.  Our meeting is indeed a fortunate accident but "
"now that I have your attention would you be interested in trading in some "
"goods?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Some mercenaries I met mentioned this place, said its a good place to find "
"some work and possibly some valuable post-apocalyptic gear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"You guys aren't as slick as you think.  You think no one's gonna notice a "
"pristine looking meteorological station in the middle of nowhere with not a "
"potted plant out of place?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/robofac/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
msgid ""
"Not without significantly advanced surveillance tech most of which were "
"either decommissioned or destroyed post cataclysm."
msgstr ""
